{:edb/committed true :edb/basis-t 1762 :edb/replayed false :edb/tx-hash "9cef03f786f132d4c6b5cc10ed2267b90aa25ca714aab90c31dc19c62958bb4f" :edb/db-before-t 1761 :edb/db-after-t 1762 :edb/tx-data [[13194139535074 50 #inst "2026-10-08T16:15:48.371Z" 13194139535074 true] [17592186100807 1020 #edb/ref 17592186329896 13194139535074 true] [17592186101213 1100 "Find the particular solution to the differential equation $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}={e}^{4x-y}$ that satisfies $y(0)=5.$" 13194139535074 true] [17592186101213 1100 "Find the particular solution to the differential equation $\\frac{dy}{dx} = e^{4x - y}$ that satisfies $y(0) = 5$." 13194139535074 false] [17592186101213 1145 "Multiply by $e^y$ and integrate:\n$$e^y\\frac{dy}{dx}=e^{4x},\\qquad e^y=\\frac14e^{4x}+C.$$\nAt $x=0$, $y=5$, so $C=e^5-1/4$. Therefore\n$$y=\\ln\\left(\\frac{e^{4x}+4e^5-1}{4}\\right).$$" 13194139535074 false] [17592186101213 1145 "We first find the general solution and then apply the given initial condition to find a particular solution.\n\nSeparating variables and integrating both sides with respect to $x,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & ={e}^{4x-y} \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & ={e}^{4x}\\cdot {e}^{-y} \\\\ {e}^{y}\\,\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & ={e}^{4x} \\\\ \\int {e}^{y}\\,\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int {e}^{4x}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\int {e}^{y}\\,\\text{d}y & =\\int {e}^{4x}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ {e}^{y} & =\\frac{{e}^{4x}}{4}+C\\,.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nApplying the natural logarithm to both sides, we find the general solution:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{ln}⁡({e}^{y}) & =\\operatorname{ln}⁡(\\frac{{e}^{4x}}{4}+C) \\\\ y & =\\operatorname{ln}⁡(\\frac{{e}^{4x}}{4}+C)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe now apply the condition $y(0)=5$ to find $C:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y(0) & =5 \\\\ \\operatorname{ln}⁡(\\frac{{e}^{4\\cdot 0}}{4}+C) & =5 \\\\ \\operatorname{ln}⁡(\\frac{1}{4}+C) & =5 \\\\ \\frac{1}{4}+C & ={e}^{5} \\\\ C & =\\frac{4{e}^{5}-1}{4}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThus the particular solution of $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}={e}^{4x-y}$ that satisfies the condition $y(0)=5$ is\n\n$$\ny=\\operatorname{ln}⁡(\\frac{{e}^{4x}+4{e}^{5}-1}{4}).\n$$" 13194139535074 true] [17592186329896 1017 #edb/ref 17592186329897 13194139535074 true] [17592186329896 1089 "q-355576" 13194139535074 true] [17592186329896 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139535074 true] [17592186329896 1100 "Find the specific solution to the differential equation $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}={e}^{-2x-y}$ given that  $\\,y(0)=2.$\n\n$y(x)=\\operatorname{ln}⁡($\n{{field-1}} $)$" 13194139535074 true] [17592186329896 1113 #uuid "c9a525de-458e-59f4-9fd7-b95961958051" 13194139535074 true] [17592186329896 1145 "We first find the general solution and then apply the given initial condition to find a particular solution.\n\nSeparating variables and integrating both sides with respect to $x,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & ={e}^{-2x-y} \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & ={e}^{-2x}{e}^{-y} \\\\ {e}^{y}\\,\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & ={e}^{-2x} \\\\ \\int {e}^{y}\\,\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int {e}^{-2x}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\int {e}^{y}\\,\\text{d}y & =\\int {e}^{-2x}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ {e}^{y} & =-\\frac{1}{2}{e}^{-2x}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nApplying the natural logarithm to both sides, we find the general solution:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{ln}⁡({e}^{y}) & =\\operatorname{ln}⁡(-\\frac{1}{2}{e}^{-2x}+C) \\\\ y & =\\operatorname{ln}⁡(-\\frac{1}{2}{e}^{-2x}+C).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe now apply the condition $y(0)=2$ to find $C:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y(0) & =2 \\\\ \\operatorname{ln}⁡(-\\frac{1}{2}{e}^{0}+C) & =2 \\\\ \\operatorname{ln}⁡(C-\\frac{1}{2}) & =2 \\\\ C-\\frac{1}{2} & ={e}^{2} \\\\ C & =\\frac{2{e}^{2}+1}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThus the particular solution of $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}={e}^{-2x-y}$ that satisfies the condition $y(0)=2$ is\n\n$$\ny=\\operatorname{ln}⁡(\\frac{-{e}^{-2x}+2{e}^{2}+1}{2}).\n$$" 13194139535074 true] [17592186329897 1000 #edb/ref 17592186329898 13194139535074 true] [17592186329897 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139535074 true] [17592186329897 1041 "field-1" 13194139535074 true] [17592186329897 1104 #edb/ref 17592186329898 13194139535074 true] [17592186329897 1110 #uuid "0a5c2a23-78b1-5d33-84b7-dd0a8ec0c257" 13194139535074 true] [17592186329898 1034 "e^2+\\frac{1}{2}-\\frac{e^{-2x}}{2}" 13194139535074 true] [17592186329898 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535074 true] [17592186329898 1111 #uuid "981c21a9-cb33-51cd-8856-ed2cd2b77e27" 13194139535074 true]] :edb/tempids {"q-355576" 17592186329896 "q-355576/field-1" 17592186329897 "q-355576/field-1/e8d9205bd708eb61e871039ac7460feaacd17607dc48f590232c13dd2390dc68" 17592186329898}}
